<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Missile-Defense on Lionel Blog</title><link>https://hybridego.github.io/tags/missile-defense/</link><description>Recent content in Missile-Defense on Lionel Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-KR</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 08:40:00 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hybridego.github.io/tags/missile-defense/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>LIG디펜스앤에어로스페이스·RTX: 방공 실적은 늘었는데, 3개월 성적은 왜 갈렸나</title><link>https://hybridego.github.io/2026/06/17/stock-candidate-note-air-defense-missile-electronics/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 Jun 2026 08:31:32 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://hybridego.github.io/2026/06/17/stock-candidate-note-air-defense-missile-electronics/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="lig디펜스앤에어로스페이스rtx-방공-실적은-늘었는데-3개월-성적은-왜-갈렸나"&gt;LIG디펜스앤에어로스페이스·RTX: 방공 실적은 늘었는데, 3개월 성적은 왜 갈렸나&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;이 글의 한국 시세는 네이버 금융 실시간 API의 2026-06-17 08:31 KST 표시값, 미국 시세는 2026-06-16 종가를 기준으로 한다. 9월 17일에는 LIG디펜스앤에어로스페이스 2분기 실적과 RTX 2분기 실적, 라인메탈 협력, 5,000억 원 우선주 유증, 9월 11일 종가와 9월 16일 후보 종가를 붙여 보강했다.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;주요 출처: &lt;a href="https://apnews.com/article/c04e8a7897b45a5ddeb9d27e0431dba7"&gt;AP - 2026-06-16 미국장&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://biz.chosun.com/en/en-finance/2026/06/16/LRSGIOU3FJHK7D7VNGR6XBKK6Y/"&gt;조선비즈 - K방산 중동 수요&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.upi.com/Top_News/World-News/2026/06/05/defense-stocks-surge-korean-made-missile-defense-system/2261780697187/"&gt;UPI - Korean air defense demand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://m.ajupress.com/amp/20260615115170417"&gt;아주프레스 - 방산 수출 협상&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.rtx.com/news/news-center/2026/04/21/rtx-reports-q1-2026-results-"&gt;RTX 1Q26 실적&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.rtx.com/news/news-center/2026/07/23/rtx-reports-q2-2026-results"&gt;RTX 2Q26 실적&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.rheinmetall.com/en/media/news-watch/news/2026/06/2026-06-15-rheinmetall-and-lig-defense-aerospace-establish-strategic-partnership"&gt;Rheinmetall - LIG 전략 파트너십&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.fnnews.com/news/202606260742237366"&gt;연합뉴스 - LIG 5,000억 유증&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.ligdefenseaerospace.com/eng/ir/allReportList.do"&gt;LIG IR 자료실&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.rttnews.com/3676461/lig-defense-aerospace-q2-operating-income-rises.aspx"&gt;RTTNews - LIG 2Q26&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://biz.heraldcorp.com/article/10822905"&gt;Herald Business - 한화시스템 2Q&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://biz.chosun.com/en/en-industry/2026/07/28/OFFIEYJ6UNDAFLO5ATM5MMZHUI/"&gt;조선비즈 - 한화시스템 2Q&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://cn.investing.com/equities/lig-nex1-co-ltd-historical-data"&gt;Investing.com - LIG 종가&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.marketwatch.com/investing/stock/rtx/download-data"&gt;MarketWatch - RTX 종가&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://stockanalysis.com/quote/krx/272210/history/"&gt;StockAnalysis - 한화시스템 종가&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.hanwhasystems.com/en/investment/financial-info.do"&gt;Hanwha Systems IR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.rttnews.com/3642794/hanwha-systems-turns-to-q1-loss.aspx"&gt;RTTNews - Hanwha Systems 1Q26&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이 글은 투자 추천이 아니라 공개자료로 남기는 후보 선별 기록이다. 6월에는 중동 방공 뉴스와 급등 직후 가격을 같이 보자고 적었다. 3개월이 지나 실적과 종가가 나왔으니, 그 질문이 맞았는지를 다시 본다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>